sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as REST/Plugin Client
    participant WP as UUID-aware WordPress
    participant DB as db.php/$wpdb
    participant SQL as SQL AST Adapter
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 18
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    Client->>WP: create post {title...}
    WP->>DB: INSERT post with UUID-aware fields
    DB->>SQL: parse/translate or native query
    SQL->>PG: INSERT ... RETURNING "ID"
    PG-->>SQL: UUIDv7
    SQL-->>DB: normalized result + UUID ID
    DB-->>WP: canonical UUID string
    WP->>Cache: invalidate relevant groups
    WP-->>Client: REST id: "019...-7..."
    Note over WP,DB: Never cast UUID to int or reinterpret missing FK as UUID zero
